  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Telegram. New commands: ExbilCoreSendTelegramCommand (POST /api/messaging/sent-telegram, answers 202 with an id), ExbilCoreGetTelegramMessageCommand (where a message stands), ExbilCoreTelegramEnrollCommand and ExbilCoreTelegramStatusCommand (link a subject's Telegram chat server to server: the bot cannot write to a phone number, the person must start it from a deep link). ExbilCoreMessageType gains Telegram (appended, no value shifts) and ExbilCoreAppBalanceDto gains TelegramCurrentLimit and TelegramCount. Additive and non-breaking: no existing request model, response DTO or route changed. A Telegram message costs the App one Telegram credit (422 TELEGRAM_CREDITS_EXHAUSTED without one); a subject with no linked chat is a 422 TELEGRAM_NOT_LINKED and nothing is charged; an OTP code can also be delivered on the Telegram channel. Credits are bought as a package (telegram_quantity, 0.5 XAF a message, minimum 1000). See the changelog in the README for the full list.",
